{
	"Name": "ScheduledSearch - Okta - Group / User - Privilege - Okta Admin Privilege Granted or Revoked (roll-up)",
	"Description": "Roll-up of every admin privilege grant and revocation, to either a user or a group. Revocations matter too: removing the role from a security team account is how an adversary stops being watched.\n\nEvent types: user.account.privilege.grant, user.account.privilege.revoke, group.privilege.grant, group.privilege.revoke\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/\n\nThis scheduled search is a dispatcher on \"Alert - Okta - Alert Router\". Its name is what appears as the alert name, so rename it here if you want the alerts named differently.\n\nIt ships disabled; enable it once you have reviewed the query and are happy with the volume it produces.",
	"Labels": [
		"okta"
	],
	"Schedule": "30 * * * *",
	"Duration": -3600,
	"DefaultDeploymentRules": {
		"Disabled": true,
		"RunImmediately": false
	},
	"ScheduledType": "search",
	"GUID": "d623df43-a80a-518c-a711-ac579813f0aa",
	"SearchReference": "f968bfc1-fc13-5811-aff9-257e87d1a5c9"
